s://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/5/59/Talent_Treetop_Watch.png/revision/latest?cb=20260812034040\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Talent Treetop Watch\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/5/59/Talent_Treetop_Watch.png/revision/latest?cb=20260812034040\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/5/59/Talent_Treetop_Watch.png/revision/latest?cb=20260812034040 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/5/59/Talent_Treetop_Watch.png/revision/latest?cb=20260812034040 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Talent Treetop Watch\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" data-image-key=\"Talent_Treetop_Watch.png\" data-image-name=\"Talent Treetop Watch.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"character\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Char­ac­ter</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Alyosha\" title=\"Alyosha\">Alyosha</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Talent Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Utility_Passive\" title=\"Utility Passive\">Utility Passive</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Category</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Passive_Talent\" title=\"Passive Talent\">Passive</a></div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDetails\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"info\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Displays the location of nearby <a href=\"/wiki/Snezhnaya_Local_Specialty\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Snezhnaya Local Specialty\">resources unique to Snezhnaya</a> on the <a href=\"/wiki/Mini-map\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mini-map\">mini-map</a>.</div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"utility1\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><b>Utility</b><ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Effects_Retained_Character_Fallen\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Effects Retained Character Fallen\">Effects Retained Character Fallen</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Resource\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Resource\">Resource</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Local_Specialty\" title=\"Local Specialty\">Local Specialty</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Snezhnaya_Local_Specialty\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Snezhnaya Local Specialty\">Snezhnaya Local Specialty</a></li></ul></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<b>Treetop Watch</b> is <a href=\"/wiki/Alyosha\" title=\"Alyosha\">Alyosha</a>'s <a href=\"/wiki/Utility_Passive\" title=\"Utility Passive\">Utility Passive</a>.\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Gameplay_Notes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gameplay Notes</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Preview\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Preview</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Other_Languages\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Other Languages</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Change_History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Change History</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Navigation\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Navigation</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gameplay_Notes\">Gameplay Notes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTreetop_Watch%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Alyosha must be in the active party for Treetop Watch to take effect, but he does not need to be alive.</li>\n<li>Only one local specialty will be shown on the mini-map at a time.</li>\n<li class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></li>\n<li>The following <a href=\"/wiki/Talent\" title=\"Talent\">Talent</a> is identical to this talent:\n<ul><li><span class=\"item talent\"><span class=\"item-image\"><span class=\"hidden\" data-size=\"20\" style=\"height:20px;width:20px\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Echo_of_Winter_Daydreams\" title=\"Echo of Winter Daydreams\"><img alt=\"Echo of Winter Daydreams\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Talent Echo of Winter Daydreams.png\" data-image-key=\"Talent_Echo_of_Winter_Daydreams.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/d/dd/Talent_Echo_of_Winter_Daydreams.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20260812034025\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"mobile-only\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Echo_of_Winter_Daydreams\" title=\"Echo of Winter Daydreams\"><img alt=\"Echo of Winter Daydreams\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Talent Echo of Winter Daydreams.png\" data-image-key=\"Talent_Echo_of_Winter_Daydreams.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/d/dd/Talent_Echo_of_Winter_Daydreams.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/30?cb=20260812034025\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"item-text\"> <a href=\"/wiki/Echo_of_Winter_Daydreams\" title=\"Echo of Winter Daydreams\">Echo of Winter Daydreams</a></span></span> (<a href=\"/wiki/Odette\" title=\"Odette\">Odette</a>)</li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Preview\">Preview</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class